	novel_interface.change_expression("jest")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Besides, compared to the churches in Salmonton, this one is actually really shabby.", "Soya")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("That’s true. New Opulentia is a science-oriented City. There aren’t a lot of religious buildings of this scale.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But if Raphilia sees this, she’ll probably laugh and look all scornful...")
	await novel_interface.stop_music()
	novel_interface.show_character("john", "perspire")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("We... almost... there...", "John")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_fishnet", "upset")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("John, you don’t look too good...", "Lian")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Before I can finish my sentence, John’s pale lips twitch, and the next thing I know he’s collapsed onto the ground.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_fishnet", "serious")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("What’s going on?", "Lian")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Beatrice immediately steps forward to check on him. She reaches out to touch John’s motionless body, and draws her hand back immediately, as if shocked.")
	novel_interface.change_music("res://assets/audio/music/Witch's Confession.mp3")
	novel_interface.show_character("beatrice_regular", "angry")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("... Blood?", "Beatrice")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("On John’s black pants is a huge patch of congealed blood. It must have come from a single source, gradually increasing in size.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("That was why we’ve been smelling—or sensing, in Sonya’s case—blood for a while.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The boy’s face is utterly colorless. His pulse is quick and weak—all symptoms of blood loss.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Beatrice asks the black SUV at the church gate to bring John to the closest hospital right away. She hops in as well.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Out of the two other vehicles she requested, one is tasked to drive Elluka back to the SID headquarters, while the other remains in spot waiting for us.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Before she leaves, Beatrice warns us multiple times to stay indoors at all times.")
	novel_interface.show_character("beatrice_regular", "angry")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Seems like it’s going to be an eventful night.", "Beatrice")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Sonya tells me she discovered a wound on John’s thigh, less than one inch long. A glass shard was still stuck inside.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("He must have hurt himself when he knocked over the billboard. He should’ve been in tremendous pain, having to walk with a wound like that...")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But, in fact, he didn’t seem to have felt it at all.")

	print("=== 天启篇第13话结束 ===")
	
	# 调用剧情结束函数
	await novel_interface.end_story_episode(0.5)
